WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.408 --> 00:00:19.051
we reach the Western Paradise soon," said the Tang Monk one morning.

2
00:00:19.992 --> 00:00:22.614
Wukong and his companions were eating breakfast.

3
00:00:25.437 --> 00:00:26.317
The monkey laughed.

4
00:00:26.337 --> 00:00:29.320
"The journey will take many years, Master!

5
00:00:30.704 --> 00:00:33.245
And you must face many challenges along the way.

6
00:00:34.686 --> 00:00:38.028
Buddha doesn't give the True Scriptures to just anyone.

7
00:00:38.928 --> 00:00:42.710
You must prove you're worthy by surviving a long and difficult journey."

8
00:00:44.971 --> 00:00:45.891
The monk sighed.

9
00:00:47.532 --> 00:00:48.632
put down his bowl.

10
00:00:48.652 --> 00:00:50.773
"I'm tired of this journey!"

11
00:00:51.054 --> 00:00:51.634
he cried.

12
00:00:51.694 --> 00:00:54.095
"My legs hurt.

13
00:00:54.155 --> 00:00:56.156
And we never have enough food."

14
00:00:57.784 --> 00:01:00.606
thinking about food, Bajie," said Wukong.

15
00:01:00.626 --> 00:01:02.787
"We're Buddhist monks now.

16
00:01:03.628 --> 00:01:06.889
We should think only about reaching the Western Paradise."

17
00:01:09.671 --> 00:01:10.612
The pig sighed.

18
00:01:12.112 --> 00:01:15.574
After he washed the bowls, the three companions headed down the road.

19
00:01:17.155 --> 00:01:18.616
They soon reached a river.

20
00:01:20.437 --> 00:01:24.539
The water splashed, and a purple monster leaped from the waves.

21
00:01:26.472 --> 00:01:27.432
"Master, stay back!"

22
00:01:27.773 --> 00:01:28.673
shouted Wukong.

23
00:01:29.513 --> 00:01:33.275
He pulled out his iron bar and blocked the monster's spear.

24
00:01:35.916 --> 00:01:39.037
Bajie lunged at the monster, swinging his rake.

25
00:01:40.758 --> 00:01:42.999
The monster dived back into the river.

26
00:01:43.019 --> 00:01:47.021
"Bajie, my powers aren't strong underwater," said Wukong.

27
00:01:47.041 --> 00:01:50.422
"Dive in, and get him to chase you out of the river.

28
00:01:51.002 --> 00:01:51.943
Then I'll surprise him."

29
00:01:52.963 --> 00:01:54.304
"Okay," said the pig.

30
00:01:54.984 --> 00:01:57.606
"Let's wait until he comes all the way up on shore though.

31
00:01:58.527 --> 00:02:01.509
Then I'll block his path so he can't go back in the river."

32
00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:04.372
Bajie dived into the water.

33
00:02:05.253 --> 00:02:06.073
Wukong waited.

34
00:02:07.374 --> 00:02:10.737
A moment later the pig was back with the monster following.

35
00:02:12.238 --> 00:02:14.780
The monkey swung his iron bar—and missed.

36
00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:18.023
The monster dived back underwater.

37
00:02:18.043 --> 00:02:24.696
"You didn't wait until he was on shore," said Bajie.

38
00:02:24.716 --> 00:02:25.777
"You're too impatient!"

39
00:02:26.437 --> 00:02:27.978
Wukong shrugged and laughed.

40
00:02:29.939 --> 00:02:30.859
yell at the monster.

41
00:02:31.379 --> 00:02:32.200
Maybe he'll come back."

42
00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:36.462
Wukong and Bajie yelled at the river for more than an hour.

43
00:02:37.602 --> 00:02:39.783
But the monster did not come back.

44
00:02:41.764 --> 00:02:43.365
Finally the monkey sighed.

45
00:02:43.385 --> 00:02:47.927
"We can't cross this river with the monster in there.

46
00:02:48.627 --> 00:02:49.948
I'll ask Guanyin for help."

47
00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:55.182
Wukong went to Mount Potalaka and told Guanyin about the monster.

48
00:02:56.643 --> 00:02:59.425
name is Sha Wujing," said Guanyin.

49
00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:01.466
"He was waiting for you.

50
00:03:02.086 --> 00:03:05.588
He's going to help the Tang Monk reach the Western Paradise."

51
00:03:05.608 --> 00:03:07.709
"I didn't know that!"

52
00:03:07.969 --> 00:03:08.750
cried Wukong.

53
00:03:10.951 --> 00:03:13.312
Guanyin went back to the river with Wukong.

54
00:03:13.332 --> 00:03:16.654
"Sha Wujing!"

55
00:03:16.954 --> 00:03:17.495
she called.

56
00:03:18.115 --> 00:03:19.476
"The Tang Monk is here!"

57
00:03:20.652 --> 00:03:23.513
The monster jumped out of the river and bowed.

58
00:03:25.333 --> 00:03:27.194
sorry, Bodhisattva," he said.

59
00:03:27.214 --> 00:03:29.154
"I didn't know he'd arrived."

60
00:03:30.215 --> 00:03:33.416
"These two are his companions," said Guanyin.

61
00:03:34.196 --> 00:03:36.896
She waved her hand toward Wukong and Bajie.

62
00:03:38.637 --> 00:03:39.637
looked surprised.

63
00:03:39.657 --> 00:03:40.878
"They attacked me!"

64
00:03:40.958 --> 00:03:43.418
"You attacked us first!"

65
00:03:43.758 --> 00:03:44.699
shouted Bajie.

66
00:03:44.719 --> 00:03:50.192
"Stop arguing," said Guanyin.

67
00:03:50.212 --> 00:03:52.534
"Wujing, you will help the Tang Monk reach the West."

68
00:03:52.554 --> 00:03:55.757
"Yes, Bodhisattva," said Wujing.

69
00:03:56.578 --> 00:03:59.981
Guanyin disappeared, and Wujing joined the group.

70
00:04:02.202 --> 00:04:04.745
He led the horse while the Tang Monk rode.

71
00:04:04.765 --> 00:04:10.129
"I was being punished for breaking a glass in Heaven," said Wujing one day.

72
00:04:10.149 --> 00:04:13.632
"When we reach the Western Paradise, I will be forgiven."

73
00:04:13.652 --> 00:04:19.000
"Bajie and I were punished for crimes in Heaven too," said Wukong.

74
00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:19.841
was the horse.

75
00:04:20.521 --> 00:04:22.703
Did you know the horse is really a dragon?"

76
00:04:24.164 --> 00:04:25.084
looked doubtful.

77
00:04:25.104 --> 00:04:28.046
"This horse is too slow to be a dragon."

78
00:04:29.067 --> 00:04:29.988
"Oh, really?"

79
00:04:30.308 --> 00:04:31.008
said the monkey.

80
00:04:31.028 --> 00:04:32.209
"Watch this!"

81
00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:34.311
struck the horse.

82
00:04:34.991 --> 00:04:37.753
The horse shot down the road as fast as lightning.

83
00:04:38.394 --> 00:04:41.096
Its reins were ripped from Wujing's hand.

84
00:04:41.116 --> 00:04:43.717
"Ahh!" cried the Tang Monk.

85
00:04:45.579 --> 00:04:49.923
When the horse finally stopped, the Tang Monk was in a dark forest.

86
00:04:51.746 --> 00:04:53.007
gasped in fear.

87
00:04:53.929 --> 00:04:57.413
The forest was filled with wolves, bears, and
